# Prisma

- String ids use `@id @default(cuid())`. Declare both sides of every relation with `@relation`.
- Every model has `createdAt @default(now())` and `updatedAt @updatedAt`.
- Add `@@index` on foreign keys and on fields used in filters: `organizationId`, `status`, scheduled date, assigned technician.
- Add `@unique` or `@@unique` for real identities: serial number, invoice number, and SKU, each scoped by `organizationId`.
- Money is `Decimal @db.Decimal(12, 2)` plus a currency code. Timestamps are stored in UTC.
- Scope every read and write by `organizationId`.
- One migration per change, named for intent (`add_visit_outcome`). Do not edit a migration after it is pushed; add a new one.
- Services return the response shape. Do not pass raw Prisma results through the controller when the shape includes relations the client must not see.
